          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Safe</span></span></p>\n<p>SAL of 10-6, resulting in a potential infection rate of 1 in 1,000,000.<sup>1</sup></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Ready to use</span></span></p>\n<p>Can be stored at room temperature, unfrozen, and ready when the surgeon needs it.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Comprehensive offering</span></span></p>\n<p>Variety of grafts and sizes to choose from to fit your Craniomaxillofacial needs.</p>\n",
