    "shortDescTitle": "<p>Your complete bone grafting solution.</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>Our allograft bio implants come in a variety of grafts and sizes to fit your Craniomaxillofacial needs. We offer both demineralized and mineralized options in putty, sponge, particulate and structural forms. All of our allografts have a SAL of 10^-6, resulting in a potential infection rate of 1 in 1,000,000 and further demonstrating the unparalleled safety rate of our allografts. The implants can be stored at room temperature, unfrozen, and ready when the surgeon needs it.<br />\r\n</p>\r\n",
